Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, where did you get that? Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wound up in my pocket somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, is it real? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeremiah used them to do\Nthose cool transformations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me give that thing a quick spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to chuck this hunk of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't throw it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, I'm going to dive to\Nthe bottom of the sea to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in my pocket, so if you don't\Nwant it, just give it back to me instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly take it off\Nyour hands! Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am rather curious as to how it\Nwandered into Luffy's pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been Niji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably did it to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do it by relying on this\Nthing or some technological crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run it down, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this the power of mankind itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you guys want it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you let us put the rave suit on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can shoot laser beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you guys ten years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Frankie's got enough lasers and\Ncrap for the whole crew. No, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you insult science?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why perish the thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think science is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sorcerer's climate act\Nwas made from atmospheric
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,science and the craftsmanship\Nof our own new sub-general.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really loving life in that baton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeus, you actually tagged along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you chose your\Nstomach over loyalty to Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quite the useful servant, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's your what, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just so you know, I've been Nami's devoted\Nservant long before you showed up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's cute and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I get to live inside her\Nbaton, which never leaves her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you're yelling at\Na massive water vapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, let's power up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck's my cool\Nsuit? Stop your crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the thing only\Nworks when you do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us how it's done. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of that goon squad. No rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say the word\NVinsmoke or Germa either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're officially off limits\Nany time you're around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you dumbasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, the paper's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any coverage about\Nus crushing the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's on the front page!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it say if he made it out okay, or?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Jinbe, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says Luffy, Sanji, Jinbe, and Buggy\Nattempted to assassinate Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Tia, were the mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mastermind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Sanji! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bounty increased to\N330 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No friggin' way! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Mosshead sitting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should put him right below you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a 320 million bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your face, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a number, don't flip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they change it from alive\Nonly back to dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It changed to Vinsmoke Sanji.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.94,0:05:03.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(777,381)\blur0.9\bord10\frz22\fnAxe Hand\fsp3\c&H642924&\3c&H642924&\fscx152\fscy152}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.94,0:05:03.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(777,381)\blur0.9\bord8\frz22\fnAxe Hand\fsp3\c&HFEE7E8&\3c&HFEE7E8&\4a&HFF&\fscx152\fscy152}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 3,0:04:53.94,0:05:03.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(777,381)\blur0.9\bord0\frz22\fnAxe Hand\fsp3\c&H642924&\3c&HFEE7E8&\4a&HFF&\fscx152\fscy152}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only increased because\Nof my family's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's somehow even gloomier over there!
