Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(725,480)\t(683,725,\1a&H00&)\t(4229,4270,\1a&HFF&)}The Fifth Emperor
Dialogue: 2,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.8\fad(725,480)}The Fifth Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, everyone is abuzz\Nabout the upcoming reverie,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a conference made up of\Nall the world's leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes place in the Holy Land of\NMary Geoise once every four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Fishman Island, located\N10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's home of the Ryugu Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it, Jamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbe has finally joined Luffy's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that the two of\Nthem picked a fight with Big Mom herself.
