Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think Big Mom will be so\Nkeen to protect our country anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see if Straw Hat will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave yet, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\t(484,525,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H030303&\3c&H030303&\bord2.5}Princess Shirahoshi
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx125\fscy125}Princess Shirahoshi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, to the reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I go, Luffy won't be able to pick\Non me for being a Secret cat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you would find the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the meeting of world\Nleaders is certainly big news,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,word of Luffy's bold adventure seemed\Nto be the only thing on anyone's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story about a young\Npirate who took a stand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against the untouchable\NEmperor of the Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thrills all who hear it across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The newspaper states,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sources report that Straw Hat\NLuffy is already in control of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:07:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seven powerful pirate crews that\Nhe's recruited along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes him the captain\Nof a fleet that has
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a combined total of over\N5,000 fearsome pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not only the sworn brother\Nof the late Ace, but also Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,second in command of\Nthe Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His natural magnetism and\Nleadership skills have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drawn the evil army Germa 66 to his side,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with the Sun Pirates and\Nthe Fire Tank Pirates as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His plan to destroy Big\NMom's castle can only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be seen as a work of strategic brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Additionally, he defeated her highest-ranked\Nofficers with sheer strength alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outcome of this battle\Nclearly confirms that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatluffy is a force\Nto be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the last slide of the\Narticle makes a bold statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fifth emperor of the sea has emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this fifth emperor bullcrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The press must have lost\Ntheir damn minds giving
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.16,0:08:02.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,615)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(526,0)\t(484,526,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H030303&\3c&H030303&\bord3}Fleet Admiral Sakazuki\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.16,0:08:02.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,615)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(526,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx125\fscy125}Fleet Admiral Sakazuki\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a lavish title to a\Nlittle upstart like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral, we have a\Nproblem. The kingdom of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lulusia ship that was\Nin route to the reverie
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been attacked by pirates the king was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unharmed but princess\NComane has been kidnapped
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what was the point of an armed escort
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jack
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about Lucy. Yes,\NI saw. Okay, I'm so proud.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.25,0:08:41.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\t(476,517,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Rebecca\NA Dressrosan Lady-in-Waiting
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.25,0:08:41.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}Rebecca\NA Dressrosan Lady-in-Waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's our captain Luffy\NLand is even more famous
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now and it's kind of cool\Nout a newspaper mentions
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.13,0:08:51.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\t(480,522,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Commander Leo\NTonta Corps, Tontatta Tribe
Dialogue: 2,0:08:47.13,0:08:51.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}Commander Leo\NTonta Corps, Tontatta Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of us too don't forget\Nonce we When we arrive, Leo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you cannot bring up such matters. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't we, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe a great debt to the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the government sees\Nthem in a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is\Nconsidered a dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best to avoid trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I should show this to Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it\Nthose ships are from the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa and Prodents kingdoms\Nand not a marine in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Princess Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just as stunning as they say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the girl she's with is\Nalso a royal family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think if we can kidnap these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much we get for them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed, Princess Comane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I love nabbing royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold out for a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make that ransom real hefty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those suckers can't spot us, they can't\Ncatch us, and they'll never see us coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I love this submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sink them. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck guarding\Nagainst a torpedo! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannon! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a Marine? A captain from HQ?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.55,0:11:00.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(422,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(523,0)\t(481,523,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Captain Koby\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:10:56.55,0:11:00.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(422,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Captain Koby\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Koby did it miss the target?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your parties are from\Ndress Rosa and Prodence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't that correct a long\Nway you must be tired Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened? Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was patrolling on that Navy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you folks were being stalked\Nby some pirates just now. Underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it a torpedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Gladly missed us. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,El Meppo, how goes it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got the pirates under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lulusia princess Comane is fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.74,0:11:58.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,522)\t(475,516,\1a&H00&)\t(3478,3519,\1a&HFF&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Lieutenant Commander Helmeppo\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.74,0:11:58.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,522)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}Lieutenant Commander Helmeppo\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roast these bastards on a skewer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer! Just wait. You monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll handle them easily now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't get how your observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haki is so in tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to sense the torpedo at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A submarine—you have to be\Ncareful with pirates these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a bit too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,famous captain covey, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is he the one from rocky port?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were the marine from the incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one perpetrated by trafalgar\Nlaw of the worst generation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible this hero\Nprotected all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm hardly a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're not only daring\Nbut you're humble too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this guy looks tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fine lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only he could take a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thanks Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh sorry, I mean I just noticed the headline\Nin the newspaper you're holding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well Well, I mean, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fifth emperor of the sea has emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps reaching higher and higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I see you in the\Nnewspaper, I think back to that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Colby, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're nearly to New Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy would be happy to escort\Nyou the rest of the way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucy's your friend, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe, you like Luffy Land?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuh—uh, he's a foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worry, we won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Navy officer, and\NI need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you looked so happy when\Nyou were reading the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paper
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy Lund's in this article, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, so you are his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn my bounty only increased because of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerema's bad rep that takes\Nall the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look, my bounty's gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it's 150 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it 500 million a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That went down by a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even lower than it was two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you do something wrong, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Less people will be after your head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, how could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could harm our prestige.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Why?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(523,0)\t(481,523,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}A Port Town\NKingdom of Lulusia, Grand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(523,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}A Port Town\NKingdom of Lulusia, Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have anything left by down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is the Navy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were here to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for destroying our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momohahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy's just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lucia king is away for the reverie,\Nand he took all his best soldiers with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For pirates like me, an unguarded country\Nlike this is ripe for the picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up and listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the\NEmperor of the Sea, Blackbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work under him, and I've\Ntaken the name Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.82,0:16:52.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,660)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(526,0)\t(484,526,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H030303&\3c&H030303&\bord2.5}Captain Pinkbeard\NPinkbeard Pirates\NBounty:   52 Million
