Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would do well to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear, Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's start loading up the ships\Nand make our leader proud, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, now empty those pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, just get off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll burn this whole place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you better not let\Nthat girl escape, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that you got there, missy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what in the world could be so precious that\Nyou would dare try and hide it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the children of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really willing to\Nrisk your life for some milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please give it back to me. I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you hand over your money, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you have your\Nheavenly tribute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the heavenly tribute\Nis what we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pay to the king and the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're barely getting by as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes every last berry\Nwe can scrape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't pay the heavenly\Ntribute, we'll be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your king sounds terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fellas know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip this town apart and find\Nwhere they hid the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:18:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us, where's the tribute stashed away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our town has nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't take this money!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your grubby hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have gotten beaten if\Nyou had given us what we wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill everyone who disobeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've suffered enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave our people alone! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morley, let's do this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the ground shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is coming up from the street!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is a huge-ass trident here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two! One, two! One...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two, one, two, one, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was this\Nhuge guy doing underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's, uh, some outfit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, why is he wearing a mini skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, my eyes are up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're that into me,\Nthen just say it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are some mighty\Ntall accusations there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little boys should leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, since when do giants live underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big ol' meanies like you will be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this guy pushing the\Nroot around like it's clay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use submissive pieces of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you people and what\Ndo you want with our town?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Morley!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.68,0:21:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have all the fun without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, I've got some\Nnewly invented weapons to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you run out ahead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are these circus monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's the murder of crows here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, look, someone's on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are the birds gathering up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.32,0:22:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you attempt to harm the innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Whitebeard, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be\Nscared across the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the four captains\Nof the Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(1395,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\1a&HFF&\fad(391,0)\t(349,391,\1a&H00&)\fscx150\fscy150\c&HE9F5F0&\blur0.8\3c&HE9F5F0&\bord5}Commander Morley\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Eastern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(1395,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\fad(391,0)\fscx150\fscy150\blur0.8\bord0\c&H030200&}Commander Morley\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Eastern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.12,0:23:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still staring!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(555,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\1a&HFF&\fad(395,0)\t(353,395,\1a&H00&)\fscx150\fscy150\c&HF0EDFA&\blur0.8\3c&HF0EDFA&\bord5}Commander Belo Betty\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Western Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(555,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\fad(395,0)\fscx150\fscy150\blur0.8\bord0\c&H030200&}Commander Belo Betty\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Western Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you scared yet, scumbag?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.62,0:23:12.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(1383,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\1a&HFF&\fad(393,0)\t(351,393,\1a&H00&)\fscx150\fscy150\c&HD9EAF2&\blur0.8\3c&HD9EAF2&\bord5}Commander Lindbergh\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Southern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.62,0:23:12.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(1383,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\fad(393,0)\fscx150\fscy150\blur0.8\bord0\c&H030200&}Commander Lindbergh\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Southern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying to try my new weapons on you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.12,0:23:17.00,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(504,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\1a&HFF&\fad(391,0)\t(349,391,\1a&H00&)\fscx150\fscy150\c&HF9E7EC&\blur0.8\3c&HF9E7EC&\bord5}Commander Karasu\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Northern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.12,0:23:17.00,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b400\pos(504,625)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro H Strp\fad(391,0)\fscx150\fscy150\blur0.8\bord0\c&H030200&}Commander Karasu\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Northern Division\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't allow you to do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.36,0:23:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revolutionaries?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they here to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heee-haw!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.39,0:23:34.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(394,0)\t(353,394,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5\4c&H020302&}Officer Emporio Ivankov\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:30.39,0:23:34.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(394,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Officer Emporio Ivankov\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strawboy really is\Nsomething else, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the apple doesn't\Nfall too far from the tree.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.43,0:23:38.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\t(358,400,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Commander in Chief Monkey D. Dragon\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.43,0:23:38.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Commander in Chief Monkey D. Dragon\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.64,0:23:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew that young Sanji\Nwas a Germa 66 prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.82,0:23:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even mention it to me once!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.94,0:23:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result of that whole cake incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Jarema's been booted\Nfrom the world's government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, Straw Boy and Sanji Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as I expected, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.40,0:24:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're becoming the center of\Nattention in the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.62,0:24:01.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\t(358,400,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Officer Inazuma\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.62,0:24:01.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Officer Inazuma\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.54,0:24:05.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(401,0)\t(359,401,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Hack\NSoldier\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:24:01.54,0:24:05.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(401,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Hack\NSoldier\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm excited to see where this goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, our officers are running\Nkind of late, aren't they?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.01,0:24:12.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\t(478,519,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Koala\NAssistant Fishman Karate Instructor\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.01,0:24:12.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Koala\NAssistant Fishman Karate Instructor\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.40,0:24:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully they didn't get held\Nup too bad on their way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sabo, what you got\Ngoing on over there, honey pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.16,0:24:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.26,0:24:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your face is cramping because you keep
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smiling every time you\Nthink of the Luffy news,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.26,0:24:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.17,0:24:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boob!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Lindbergh here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are really\Nlate, what's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.00,0:24:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ran into some trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.92,0:24:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys mind if we're a bit late?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, just stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I am absolutely thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the Revolutionary Army's best\Nwill be here in the flesh at long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'll\Nget to chat with Morley!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.98,0:24:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about Betty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabo, we've wasted enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hold our meeting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well solidify\Nour plan before they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're up, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.64,0:25:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second-in-Command. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the reverie just around the\Ncorner, we'll finally take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.80,0:25:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be declaring war.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.20,0:25:20.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\t(482,524,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Chief of Staff Sabo\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.20,0:25:20.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Chief of Staff Sabo\NRevolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.82,0:25:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.38,0:25:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are four top officers\Nneeded to defend one town?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this guy is so dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only wants you for\Nyour body, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck, no thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I checked with Zeff like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.66,0:25:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we do this now, Betty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.62,0:25:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your power list is stopless, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.32,0:25:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is no one answering the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what is he mumbling about, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did this guy just snap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.66,0:26:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you pieces of\Ncrap. You're gonna help?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you die or will you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to choose your destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is playing hero someone else's job?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.56,0:26:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to cower in fear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.12,0:26:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.78,0:26:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a couple\Nof sticks are gonna stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.18,0:26:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are cracking me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, a peasant uprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but all of a sudden I\Nfeel this huge surge of power inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.58,0:26:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's force these pirates to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.90,0:26:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should fight and\Nprotect our kingdom. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.28,0:27:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're feeling the raw power\Nof Betty's pump-pump fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.80,0:27:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a mere wave of her banner, she\Ncan call forth the strength within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Betty is a flag bearer of freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.42,0:27:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess they want to see\Nwhat bullets do to their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know what they're in for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lind, Karasu, go and back them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool shooter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.68,0:27:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.98,0:27:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gun got all iced up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack those you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.78,0:27:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip them to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disarmed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.26,0:28:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The frickin' bird's door! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.84,0:28:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.70,0:28:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize your own fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.76,0:28:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.67,0:28:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.28,0:28:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.56,0:28:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make you pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peachbeard, 52 million berries, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.90,0:28:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Blackbeard will avenge\Nme, then you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but he\Ndoesn't give a crap about his thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.96,0:29:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.50,0:29:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you pathetic,\Nyellow-bellied, weak, sad sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is give\Nthem to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that sweet bounty will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.60,0:29:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be a total\Nof 52 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, make sure to use it wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.98,0:29:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I want you to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.14,0:29:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use it to contact\Nthe Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all made me proud today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.60,0:29:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hit us up anytime when the\Nweek stands up for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.86,0:29:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will always be close\Nbehind and ready to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.94,0:30:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.48,0:30:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, what exactly is the reason we're\Nmeeting up with everyone anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.76,0:30:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be picking a fight\Nwith the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.86,0:30:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now that sounds like\Na good time! Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one thing, Karasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to turn off your loudspeaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.56,0:30:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.48,0:30:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only two days remain until\Nthe reverie and the schemes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of players from around the\Nworld begin to intertwine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.76,0:30:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:31:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an update for you. Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.90,0:31:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll arrive shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.14,0:31:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.52,0:31:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.66,0:31:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen this stupid face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.98,0:31:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same guy who screwed\Nover my entire smile production.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.65,0:31:22.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\t(475,517,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Kaido, "King of the Beasts"\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 2,0:31:16.65,0:31:22.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Kaido, "King of the Beasts"\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.82,0:31:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell did he manage\Nto take down that old bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says he won.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.24,0:31:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.78,0:31:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.34,0:31:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.48,0:31:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know who wrote\Nthis slanderous article.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.70,0:31:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to teach Morgan a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Straw Hat, you're first!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:52.14,0:31:55.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(396,0)\t(354,396,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Charlotte "Big Mom" Linlin\NOne of the Four Emperors
