Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.48,0:31:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fifth Emperor now—that
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.90,0:32:01.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\t(475,517,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Marshall D. "Blackbeard" Teach\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 2,0:31:57.90,0:32:01.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Marshall D. "Blackbeard" Teach\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,title doesn't fit you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.68,0:32:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks
Dialogue: 1,0:32:09.91,0:32:12.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(268,0)\t(227,268,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}"Red-Haired" Shanks\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 2,0:32:09.91,0:32:12.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(268,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}"Red-Haired" Shanks\NOne of the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like I'll be seeing you soon. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if it got lower?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.84,0:32:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.32,0:32:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get up there again, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.12,0:32:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.06,0:32:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get it even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.76,0:32:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.67,0:32:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.24,0:32:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I believe you missed\Na few zeros here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.68,0:33:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.86,0:33:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bounty's not 150 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 1.5 billion!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.68,0:33:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the rest of the world\Nlooks towards the reverie,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats embark to the land of Wano.

